# DsToggleFilterData docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsToggleFilterData
  active={false}
  label="Toggle"
  onActiveChange={() => {}}
  onClick={() => {}}
  value="#"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsToggleFilterData label="Toggle" value="#" active={false} />;

